WEBVTT

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.490
I'm the master magician, Harukaze Doremi!

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.440
For my first trick...

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.030
Doves, come out!

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.740
Where are the doves?

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.020
How did that happen?

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.380
Good morning.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.980
What the heck's with this music?

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:03.440
Huh? I can't hear you!

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.360
I'm askin' what in the world...

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:16.050
~ Turn, turn, this world! ~

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:18.820
~ For my sake, bravo! ~

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:19.630
~ Bravo! ~

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:22.780
~ When will everyone do the shake? ~

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:27.360
~ Majo Rika, bravo! ~

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.880
What's so funny!?

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:38.170
Talent show?

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.780
Yes, there's one every year in the Witch World.

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:43.640
Everyone goes and shows off their talents.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.600
That sounds kinda tough.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:50.840
And the winner can ask the Queen to make one of her wishes come true.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:54.040
Ahh, so that's why you were practicing that weird dance.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.820
It's a samba!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.740
The Witches' Talent Show!

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.420
That song...

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:13.290
Don't tell me...

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.840
I-Isn't that Dela?

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.220
What is it this time?

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:29.180
~ Mota and Motamota want me to tell you when the next witch exam is. ~

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.650
Sorry, we're a bit busy now, so can you delay it a bit?

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.450
Oh, but there's a problem...

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:39.110
We are also...

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:44.070
busy practicing for the talent show...

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:48.300
The level 2 exam is...

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:52.050
performing at the talent show...

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:56.110
and pleasing the audience...!

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.340
That's what they said.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.540
Good luck everyone!

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:06.110
~ Well then, I have to practice my singing. ~

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:08.060
~ So I'm going back. ~

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.270
Wait!

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.020
W-What about my level 3 exam?

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.530
Did you forget?

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:18.740
It happens at the same time.

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:19.820
Later.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.560
Dela is doing her best too.

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:23.870
Thank goodness.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.560
We only need to please the audience in order to pass.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:27.660
This'll be easy!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.860
You idiot!

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:31.840
Do you know how tough the audience is at the talent show?

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.390
Come on, let's go, Ai-chan!

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.100
Let's think about what we're gonna do!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.070
I wonder what would be good?

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:40.800
Hey, hey, are you listening to me?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.620
Majo Rika, you sure have it tough.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.970
I wonder what wish I should make come true?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.460
What a pain...

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:52.400
Doremi-chan, ya need to think of a talent first.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:55.650
I think we should ask some adults.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:59.100
Then let's ask everyone tomorrow.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:04:59.610
Okay!

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:01.980
Talent show?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.400
Okay, just leave it to me.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:12.500
A snail.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.400
Well then.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.550
How about this?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.150
Baaya!

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:32.520
I'm truly sorry, My Lady!

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.740
I'm not made for talent shows!

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:38.010
I'm sorry for dirtying your face...

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:38.480
That's fine.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.560
I'll have to use <i>that</i>.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:45.860
Now then, this talent has been passed down through the Fujiwara family.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.210
I ain't too shabby am I?

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.170
Howzat? How'm I doin'?

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:00.840
Oh dear.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.270
Alright then.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:04.710
Alright, how 'bout this...

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.180
This may look like a normal string.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:11.140
Take this and...

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.180
Howzat?

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.810
I shouldn't have asked you.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.890
How'd it go Doremi-chan?

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:22.580
No good.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.000
How about you, Ai-chan?

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.620
Pretty much the same.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.200
Wow!

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:37.540
Then... this one.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:49.880
It's gone!

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:54.600
When did you...

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.560
Magic is creating miracles in the blink of an eye.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:02.610
Watabe-kun, you're so good at magic.

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:04.650
Well, you could say that.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.720
I see ya differently now.

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:08.110
Hey, ya should perform some more.

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:09.900
Sure.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.420
Then can you teach us?

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:13.530
No way.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:15.950
Why?

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.960
Well duh. It's no fun if he teaches us.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.920
And the super clumsy Doremi would never get it in the first place.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.730
That's not true!

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.670
Anyway, I have a lot of stuff to do.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.380
Stingy!

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:33.340
What should we do?

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:37.560
I guess we're gonna hafta do that weird dance.

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:43.100
I need to go buy some pencils.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.280
Um, excuse me?

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:53.950
Hi.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:58.450
E-Excuse me, I want these pencils.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.540
Sure, but these are crayons.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.320
I see, you want colored pencils.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:06.920
Huh? How?

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.840
Father, I'll look after the store.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.680
Watabe-kun!

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:13.700
Do you live here?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.470
Are they your classmates?

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.580
Ow...!

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.350
Father, you need to go lie down.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.310
Is your father okay?

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:22.770
He twisted his back.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.230
Mister, yer magic was amazing.

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:29.440
Remember, girls.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.690
Magic is creating miracles in the blink of an eye.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.160
I think I've heard that somewhere.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:39.000
If you believe in your own powers, I'm sure you too can create miracles!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:40.660
Understand?

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.700
Ow-ow-ow!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:42.240
Later.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:46.740
So Watabe-kun's interest in magic comes from his father.

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:47.900
His personality too.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:52.380
Oh, this is the poster for the magic show we put up every year.

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:54.640
Is your father performing, Watabe-kun?

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:59.200
Yes, he performs every year, but since he can't go this year, I'm doing it for him.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.610
Amazing!

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.100
You could say that.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.720
You perform magic and look after the store.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.450
You sure are busy.

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.120
Yeah, ya can ask us fer help anytime.

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:11.900
Oh hey, have you already decided on your assistant?

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.360
Well, not yet.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.060
Hey, you should let us do it!

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:19.080
Doremi-chan, I don't think he'll agree...

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:23.720
Yeah, Doremi-chan, he can teach us magic in return!

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:26.880
It's a fabulous idea, we should do it...

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:31.140
Well, watch closely and see if you can do what I do.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.890
Oh, a miracle!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.060
Oh, danger!

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.840
Majo Rika, you'll throw out your back.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.170
Can it! I don't care!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:24.430
Okay, everyone, tomorrow is the magic show.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:28.240
There's no way I will fail.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:28.880
That being said.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:32.160
Senoo-san, please be the MC.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:35.040
But I ain't so good at public speakin'.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:37.600
Fujiwara-san, you'll be my assistant.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.280
I wonder if I can do it...

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.360
Don't worry, just have confidence. I'll leave it to you.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.240
Well, that's it.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.020
Yup, that's it.

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:46.620
Hey, what about me?

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:48.520
Oh yeah.

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:51.960
Let me see... Harukaze-san, ah yes, you can be the stage manager.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.010
Stage manager?

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:56.740
Me?

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.070
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:24.510
the magic show is about to begin.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:28.350
First, I shall introduce our master magician,

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.330
Watabe!

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:36.430
What sorts of magic will he perform?

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:38.260
Feast your eyes and watch!

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:42.960
To start...!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:53.100
That's just a small trick, don't get excited yet! There's more to come!

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:59.860
What stage manager? It sounds cool, but I don't get to do anything!

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:04.000
Next, he takes off his hat, an ordinary silk hat.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:06.330
As you can see, it's empty inside.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:09.290
Now, what will come out?

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.870
The doves escaped!

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:22.260
Hey, Hadzuki-chan! The doves, the doves!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.930
What should I do? Hadzuki-chan can't hear me.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:27.650
That's it!

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:29.600
I can do my job as stage manager!

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.990
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:52.180
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.040
Have doves come out of the top hat!

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.430
Doremi-chan?

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:10.720
Oh no, not now, Doremi-chan.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.850
Okay!

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:21.170
Doves sure are cheap nowadays.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:21.980
Next trick.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:26.320
N-Now then, I'll pull a series of flags out of my hat.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:32.870
It's stuck!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.120
Huh? Again?

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:40.090
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:54.200
I think the doves had somethin' to do with this.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.770
Water, come out!

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.570
Eh?

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.070
Now there's no water?

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:10.200
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:14.240
Water, come out!

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:30.970
Wow, it's a deluge! What a performance!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:36.930
Watabe-kun?

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:42.860
Everyone, we'll have a short break here. Don't go away!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.770
I can't do this anymore.

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.560
Why are there so many accidents?

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:53.620
What're ya talkin' about?

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:54.990
The audience loves ya.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.330
That doesn't matter, I'm just a failure.

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:00.780
I've never messed up like this before.

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:02.540
Don't beat yourself up like that.

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:06.660
I've never done the next trick in front of an audience!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:09.500
And this rate I'll definitely fail.

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:10.650
Watabe-kun.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.010
Harukaze-san?

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.010
Magic is creating miracles in the blink of an eye.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:20.850
If you believe in your own powers, I'm sure you too can create miracles!

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:24.310
My... own powers?

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.750
Yes, your own powers.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:28.780
Isn't that what your father said?

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.240
My own powers...

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:36.500
And when I saw your magic for the first time, it was unbelievable.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:37.960
It was amazing!

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.640
Yeah, it was really exciting!

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:40.540
It was great!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.250
Really?

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:45.380
Yes, so I think you can definitely do this, Watabe-kun.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.300
Me too.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.590
I think you'll definitely be fine.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.580
I understand.

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:55.050
I'll do it!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:15:59.930
Sorry for the wait!

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.140
The moment you've all been waiting for!

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.330
He's all tied up.

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:07.610
So, what are you going to do?

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:15.530
Now, watch closely!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.420
What? He disappeared!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.970
Thank goodness the magic show went well.

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:12.110
A few things happened though.

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.300
Well, don't sweat the small stuff.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.840
Now, since we're almost late, let's hurry to the talent show.

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:27.900
What <i>is</i>  this? The witches are all drunkards.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.770
Hey, that's Majo Rika over there.

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:33.560
~ Turn, turn, this world! ~

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:36.480
~ For my sake, bravo! ~

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.230
~ Bravo! ~

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.450
~ When will everyone do the shake? ~

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:39.920
You suck!

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:40.880
~ Majo Rika, bravo! ~

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:42.740
You're the shame of all witches!

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.340
That's too much.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.420
They worked so hard on it too.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:47.710
I feel so sorry for Majo Rika.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:57.780
Wow!

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:01.080
You suck! Get off the stage!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.600
What? I thought it was good.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.500
If it's magic, then I know how to do it too.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:09.060
Next up are three witch apprentices!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.180
Finally.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:13.020
Will they be okay?

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:16.480
I hope they haven't forgotten that this is an exam.

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:18.420
What should we do?

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.440
We can't use magic, so how can we pass?

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.150
I think we should quit.

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:25.450
That's a good idea. We'll just take the exam another time.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.080
Witch apprentices are boring!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.800
You're ruining my drink!

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.200
Go back home and sleep!

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.820
What did ya say!?

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.000
Alright! As a woman from Osaka, I ain't gonna lose!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.030
I'll just do this.

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:42.300
Take a good look!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.030
My dad's special trick!

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:51.810
Cat's cradle!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:04.400
Pretty good, but y'all need more practice!

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:06.520
So Hadzuki-chan, what's yer routine?

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:10.040
Eh? Me? What should I do?

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:14.420
Um... I will turn my head around once.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:17.420
Can these Ojamajos pull through?

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.270
Baaya's special trick, head turning!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.890
What!? How is she doing that!?

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:43.690
Eh? How's she doing that?

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:44.850
This is how...

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:50.960
Amazing, Hadzuki-chan.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.920
Doremi-chan, it's your turn next.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.220
Yes, Doremi-chan, go fer it!

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:56.680
Doremi-chan, you can do it!

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:59.790
Ya ain't gonna pass the exam if ya keep stallin' like this.

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:00.380
The exam...?

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:08.640
That's right... I'm stuck at level 4, while Ai-chan and Hadzuki-chan have already made it to level 2.

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:10.510
Alright.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.950
Magic is creating miracles in the blink of an eye.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:24.410
If you believe in your own powers, I'm sure you too can create miracles!

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:28.870
Alright, here I go!

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:39.170
What!? My finger stretched!

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:44.130
Her finger stretched!

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:48.280
W-Wow, she did that without magic!

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:50.100
What a dangerous trick!

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:53.060
Your Majesty.

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.470
Wow, how did she do that?

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:09.840
The audience is pleased, so you three...

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:11.660
Pass...!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.840
Yes!

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:18.250
The winners of this year's talent show are our three Ojamajos!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:24.100
I thank you three from the bottom of my heart for making the audience happy.

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:26.720
With that, I can grant one of your wishes.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.710
Yes! I want to eat steak...

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:32.560
Please let Doremi-chan skip levels!

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:35.980
You all want to be level 2 apprentices together?

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:37.050
Yes!

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:39.770
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan.

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:46.570
Congratulations...

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:49.570
I passed level 2!

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:51.730
That's great, Doremi-chan.

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:53.440
Thank you!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:03.500
I ain't gonna go to that arranged marriage meeting!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:04.160
Ai-chan...

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:05.200
Is it about your father?

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:08.050
I don't want my dad to marry someone else!

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:10.960
All I want is my one and only mom!

00:22:10.960 --> 00:22:12.120
Ai-chan...

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:13.270
I'll ruin it...

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:15.780
Ya better watch out, Dad!

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:18.140
I'll absolutely destroy this meeting!

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:19.020
Hey wait, Ai-chan!

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:19.720
I understand.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:21.700
I'll cheer you on, Ai-chan.

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:23.560
H-Hadzuki-chan too?

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:24.660
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:25.980
Dad's Arranged Marriage Meeting.

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:28.710
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
